    {
      "source": "Check whether this <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a> is equal to another <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>.",
