    {
      "source": "Renders to: <code>(&amp;gt;SELECT&amp;lt;) AS &amp;gt;ALIAS&amp;lt;</code> in a from or join clause, and to <code>&amp;gt;ALIAS&amp;lt;</code> when\nused in an expression.",
      "translation": "渲染为 from 或 join 子句中的<code>(&amp;gt;SELECT&amp;lt;) AS &amp;gt;ALIAS&amp;lt;</code>，以及在表达式中使用时渲染为<code>&amp;gt;ALIAS&amp;lt;</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that this does not implement <a href=\"Aliased.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Aliased</code></a> because the Alias is not optional but required and therefore more\nlike a name although the SQL term is \"alias\".",
      "translation": "请注意，此处并未实现 <a href=\"Aliased.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Aliased</code></a>，因为别名并非可选而是必需的，因此它更像是一个名称，尽管在 SQL 术语中被称为“别名”。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Equality is typically given if the <a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a> representation matches.",
      "translation": "当 `<a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a>` 的表示形式匹配时，通常认为相等。",
      "count": 1
    },
